{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2021-06-29 09:15:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL ANNOUNCES $8.0 BILLION FIXED ANNUITY REINSURANCE TRANSACTION WITH GLOBAL ATLANTIC', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) (“THE COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS INSURANCE SUBSIDIARIES, RIVERSOURCE LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY (“RIVERSOURCE LIFE”) AND RIVERSOURCE LIFE INSURANCE CO. OF NEW YORK (“RIVERSOURCE LIFE OF NEW YORK” AND TOGETHER WITH RIVERSOURCE LIFE, “RIVERSOURCE”), HAVE ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH GLOBAL ATLANTIC FINANCIAL GROUP'S SUBSIDIARIES COMMONWEALTH ANNUITY AND LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY AND FIRST ALLMERICA FINANCIAL LIFE INSURANCE CO"}